        "created_at": "2016-02-10T17:50:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We won a 5-player match against Iron Legacy last night, acheiving a&nbsp;Flawless Victory (every hero at full strength at the end of the game). &nbsp;We used a convenient Meteor Shower to shield everything from damage, while The Argent Adept stripped Iron Legacy of his ongoing cards using Sarabande of Destruction, Tempest healed the heroes from previous damage with Cleansing Downpour, and everyone built up their cards in play for an overwhelming alpha-strike. &nbsp;The Argent Adept was first to play and destroyed the Meteor Shower with the Sarabande so he didn't have to sacrfice his whole turn. &nbsp;Iron Legacy was defeated on the round after the Meteor Storm was removed.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:33.092Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
